@startuml
scale 1.6
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9F5
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FCE7F3
skinparam participantBorderColor #DB2777
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam noteBorderColor #CA8A04

title 用户使用医学助手全流程\n(从提问到获得带证据的结构化医学回答)

actor "医生/患者\n(用户)" as User
participant "Web UI\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "HTTP Server\n(Fastify)" as Server
participant "Medical\nAgentExecutor" as Agent
participant "Entity\nRecognizer" as Entity
participant "Safety\nLayer" as Safety
participant "Query\nPlanner" as Planner
participant "Enhanced\nRetrieval" as Retrieval
participant "Medical\nReasoner" as Reasoner
participant "Evidence\nEvaluator" as Evidence

User -> Frontend: 输入查询:\n"糖尿病患者合并肾功能不全\neGFR=35，二甲双胍能否使用？"

Frontend -> Frontend: 构建请求:\n{query, enableAgent: true, topK: 5,\n maxContextTokens: 4000}

Frontend -> Server: POST /api/chat/generate\n(Content-Type: application/json)

Server -> Agent: 创建 AgentExecutor\nmaxIterations: 5\nconfidenceThreshold: 0.8\nuseRuleBasedDecide: true

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:input"

== Phase 1: 实体识别 Entity Recognition ==

Agent -> Entity: identifyEntities(query)

Entity -> Entity: 词典匹配:\n疾病词典: "糖尿病" ✓\n药物词典: "二甲双胍" ✓\n指标词典: "eGFR" ✓\n关系词典: "能否使用" → 禁忌检查

Entity -> Entity: 提取数值:\neGFR = 35 (指标值)

Entity --> Agent: entities = [\n  {name:"二甲双胍", type:"drug", confidence:0.95},\n  {name:"糖尿病", type:"disease", confidence:0.90},\n  {name:"eGFR", type:"indicator", value:35, confidence:0.92}\n]

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:entities"\n{entityMatches, keywordMatches}

== Phase 2: 安全预检查 Safety Layer (最高优先级) ==

Agent -> Safety: performSafetyCheck(entities, thresholds)

Safety -> Safety: Step 1: 禁忌阈值匹配\ndrug="二甲双胍", indicator="eGFR=35"\n\n从配置加载禁忌阈值:\n• eGFR ≥ 45 → 可用\n• eGFR 30-45 → 慎用(relative)\n• eGFR < 30 → 禁用(absolute)\n\n判断: 35 在 30-45 范围\n→ severity = "relative"

Safety -> Safety: Step 2: 药物相互作用检测\n仅一个药物 → 无相互作用

Safety --> Agent: SafetyAssessment {\n  severity: "relative",\n  contraindicationMatches: [{\n    drug: "二甲双胍",\n    indicator: "eGFR",\n    patientValue: 35,\n    threshold: "<45 (慎用)",\n    severity: "relative",\n    recommendation: "eGFR 30-45时慎用，需减量"\n  }]\n}

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:complexity"\n{level:"moderate", needsPlanning:false}

== Phase 3: 查询规划 Query Planning ==

Agent -> Planner: buildQueryStrategy(entities, query)

Planner -> Planner: 构建主查询:\n"二甲双胍 eGFR 肾功能不全 禁忌症 用法"\n\n扩展术语:\n"格华止"、"美迪康"\n"肾小球滤过率"\n"Metformin contraindication renal"

Planner -> Planner: 构建过滤条件:\n• 指南年份: 2020-2024\n• 领域: diabetes, nephrology

Planner --> Agent: QueryStrategy {\n  primaryQuery: "二甲双胍 eGFR 肾功能不全 禁忌症",\n  expandedTerms: [...],\n  filters: {year: [2020,2024]},\n  subQueries: []\n}

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:query_rewrite"\n{queryRewriting, query}

== Phase 4: ReAct 循环 (ReAct Mode) ==

Agent -> Agent: 初始化状态:
• iteration = 0
• satisfied = false
• maxIterations = 5

== Iteration 1 ==

Agent -> Agent: **Think**: 规则化决策\n(useRuleBasedDecide=true)\n\n检查满足规则 (按优先级):\n1. retrievalCount ≥ 3? → 待检索\n2. maxSimilarity > 0.7? → 待检索\n3. entityCoverage ≥ 80%? → 待检索\n→ 结论: 需要检索

Agent -> Retrieval: **Act**: 执行检索\nquery=primaryQuery + expandedTerms

Retrieval -> Retrieval: EnhancedRetrievalPipeline:\nAnalyze → Rewrite → Expand →\nSmall-to-Big → Rerank → Assemble

Retrieval --> Agent: retrievalResults: 5条\n(ADA指南, KDIGO指南, 中国2型糖尿病指南...)

Agent -> Agent: **Observe**: 记录检索结果
• 实体覆盖率: 100% (二甲双胍✓ eGFR✓ 肾功能✓)
• 最高相似度: 0.88

== Iteration 2 ==

Agent -> Agent: **Think**: 规则化决策
\n检查满足规则:\n1. retrievalCount(5) ≥ 3 ✓\n2. maxSimilarity(0.88) > 0.7 ✓\n3. entityCoverage(100%) ≥ 80% ✓\n→ 结论: SATISFIED

Agent -> Agent: satisfied = true\n跳出循环
\nLLM调用次数: 0!

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:execution"\n{executorState, satisfied:true}

== Phase 5: 答案生成 Answer Generation ==

Agent -> Reasoner: 三层综合回答\nparseAnswer(response, entities, retrievalResults,\n  safetyAssessment, evidenceEvaluation)

Reasoner -> Reasoner: **Layer 1: Safety Layer 优先**
safetyAssessment.severity = "relative"\n→ 结论优先采用安全建议

Reasoner -> Evidence: evaluateEvidence(retrievalResults)

Evidence -> Evidence: 文献类型识别:\nADA Standards → guideline → Grade B\nKDIGO GL → guideline → Grade B\n中国指南 → guideline → Grade B

Evidence -> Evidence: 权威度评分:\nADA: 国际 1.0\nKDIGO: 国际 1.0\n中国指南: 国家 0.8\n\n时效性检查:\n2024年 → weight = 1.0 (最新)

Evidence --> Reasoner: EvidenceEvaluation {\n  overallGrade: "B",\n  sourceTypes: ["guideline"],\n  compositeScore: 0.86\n}

Reasoner -> Reasoner: **Layer 2: 检索结果综合**\n合并多个指南的推荐意见

Reasoner -> Reasoner: 构建结构化回答

Reasoner --> Agent: MedicalAnswer {\n  conclusion: {\n    text: "慎用：eGFR 30-45ml/min时\n          二甲双胍需减量使用",\n    confidence: "high"\n  },\n  details: { points: [\n    "eGFR≥45: 可正常使用",\n    "eGFR 30-45: 慎用，需减量至500-850mg/日",\n    "eGFR<30: 禁用"\n  ]},\n  evidenceGrade: { grade: "B", sourceType: "guideline" },\n  sources: [\n    "ADA Standards 2024, Section 9",\n    "KDIGO CKD Guidelines 2024"\n  ],\n  warnings: [\n    "本回答仅供参考，不构成医疗建议",\n    "请咨询专业医生后再做决定"\n  ]\n}

Server -> Frontend: WebSocket → "agent:complete"\n{agentResult: {satisfied:true,\n  retrievalCount:5, totalTimeMs:1500,\n  iterations:2, llmCallCount:1}}

== Phase 6: 流式输出答案 ==

Reasoner -> Server: 格式化 Markdown 回答

Server -> Frontend: SSE 流式推送

Frontend -> Frontend: 解析并渲染:\n• 🟢 结论 (高置信度)\n• 📋 详细说明 (3条)\n• 📊 证据等级 (Grade B)\n• 📚 来源引用 (2条)\n• ⚠️ 注意事项

Frontend -> User: 🔍 检索分析\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n原始查询 → 实体识别 → 优化查询 → 执行路径\n\n## 结论\n慎用：eGFR 30-45ml/min时二甲双胍需减量使用\n\n## 详细说明\n• eGFR≥45: 可正常使用\n• eGFR 30-45: 慎用，需减量至500-850mg/日\n• eGFR<30: 禁用\n\n## 证据等级\nGrade B - ADA指南推荐\n\n## 来源引用\n1. ADA Standards 2024, Section 9\n2. KDIGO CKD Guidelines 2024\n\n## ⚠️ 注意事项\n本回答仅供参考，不构成医疗建议

@enduml
